<title>NETHERLANDS: Gamma H1 net rises 22 percent.</title>
<headline>Gamma H1 net rises 22 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELMOND, Netherlands 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.68 vs   3.01</p>
<p>    Net profit			    24.7  vs  20.2</p>
<p>    Turnover			     668.19 vs 671.53</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    42.6  vs  37.6</p>
<p>    Financial charges		    3.0  vs   5.1</p>
<p>    Tax				     14.9  vs  12.3</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Gamma Holding NV.</p>
</text>
